<title>POLAND: GPRD plans PLN 1.0 mln for 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>GPRD plans PLN 1.0 mln for 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish roadbuilder Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA (GPRD) plans to earmark one million zlotys of its 1996 net profit for dividend, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Last year GPRD had a net profit of 7.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>GPRD has 7.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
